<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Processing Layer – QMJ Transform on AWS FCJ Capstone Report - Nguyễn Ngọc Tuấn Khanh</title><link>https://Oolongk.github.io/aws-project/2-workshop/2.5-stock-screener/3-processing-layer/</link><description>Recent content in Processing Layer – QMJ Transform on AWS FCJ Capstone Report - Nguyễn Ngọc Tuấn Khanh</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>vi</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 06 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://Oolongk.github.io/aws-project/2-workshop/2.5-stock-screener/3-processing-layer/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Tạo Glue PySpark Job để chạy QMJ Transform</title><link>https://Oolongk.github.io/aws-project/2-workshop/2.5-stock-screener/3-processing-layer/3.1-create-glue-pyspark-job/</link><pubDate>Mon, 06 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://Oolongk.github.io/aws-project/2-workshop/2.5-stock-screener/3-processing-layer/3.1-create-glue-pyspark-job/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;QMJ Transform là Spark ETL Job đọc toàn bộ Raw Parquet bằng &lt;code&gt;recursiveFileLookup&lt;/code&gt; và ghi output theo &lt;code&gt;as_of_date&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="upload-transform-script"&gt;Upload transform script&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
	&lt;thead&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;th&gt;Bước&lt;/th&gt;
					&lt;th&gt;Hành động&lt;/th&gt;
					&lt;th&gt;Chi tiết kỹ thuật&lt;/th&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
	&lt;/thead&gt;
	&lt;tbody&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;1&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Amazon S3 → &lt;code&gt;stock-screener-raw-tên-của-bạn/glue-scripts/&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Dùng script prefix hiện có&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;2&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Chọn &lt;strong&gt;Upload&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Upload &lt;code&gt;qmj_transform.py&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;3&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Kiểm tra S3 URI&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;s3://stock-screener-raw-tên-của-bạn/glue-scripts/qmj_transform.py&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
	&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;h2 id="tạo-spark-job"&gt;Tạo Spark Job&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
	&lt;thead&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;th&gt;Bước&lt;/th&gt;
					&lt;th&gt;Hành động&lt;/th&gt;
					&lt;th&gt;Chi tiết kỹ thuật&lt;/th&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
	&lt;/thead&gt;
	&lt;tbody&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;1&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;AWS Glue → ETL jobs → &lt;strong&gt;Create job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Mở wizard tạo Job&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;2&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Chọn job type&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Chọn &lt;strong&gt;Spark&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;3&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Nhập Job name&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;us-stock-qmj-transform&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;4&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Chọn IAM Role&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;AWSGlueServiceRole-StockScreener&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;5&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Chọn Script path&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;URI của &lt;code&gt;qmj_transform.py&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;6&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Chọn Glue runtime&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Dùng Spark runtime đã test với project&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;7&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Chọn capacity&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Bắt đầu nhỏ, tăng sau khi xem duration và memory&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;8&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Mở &lt;strong&gt;Job parameters&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Nhập args ở bảng bên dưới&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;9&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Chọn &lt;strong&gt;Save&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Lưu job&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;10&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Chọn &lt;strong&gt;Run&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Test &lt;code&gt;AS_OF_DATE&lt;/code&gt; có Raw data&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
	&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;h2 id="job-parameters"&gt;Job parameters&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
	&lt;thead&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;th&gt;Key&lt;/th&gt;
					&lt;th&gt;Value mẫu&lt;/th&gt;
					&lt;th&gt;Source sử dụng&lt;/th&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
	&lt;/thead&gt;
	&lt;tbody&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;--RAW_BUCKET&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;stock-screener-raw-tên-của-bạn&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Override Raw Bucket&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;--RAW_PREFIX&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;raw_us_market&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Override Raw prefix&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;--PROCESSED_BUCKET&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;stock-screener-processed-tên-của-bạn&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Override Processed Bucket&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;--PROCESSED_PREFIX&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;processed_qmj&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Override Processed prefix&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;--AS_OF_DATE&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;2026-07-03&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Cut-off date để lấy info, prices, financial reports&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;--LOOKBACK_DAYS&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;800&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Lookback calendar days cho price history&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;--MIN_PRICE_OBSERVATIONS&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;200&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Đang parse nhưng chưa được filter trong source hiện tại&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
	&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-text" data-lang="text"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;Trong Glue Console, key phải bắt đầu bằng hai dấu gạch ngang.
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;Ví dụ: --AS_OF_DATE
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description></item><item><title>Phân tích và triển khai QMJ PySpark Transform</title><link>https://Oolongk.github.io/aws-project/2-workshop/2.5-stock-screener/3-processing-layer/3.2-qmj-pyspark-transformation/</link><pubDate>Mon, 06 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://Oolongk.github.io/aws-project/2-workshop/2.5-stock-screener/3-processing-layer/3.2-qmj-pyspark-transformation/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Source transform hiện tại chỉ đọc S3 Raw và ghi S3 Processed. Không có lệnh ghi DynamoDB trực tiếp; Chương 4 dùng Publisher Job riêng để đọc Processed Parquet và publish sang Serving Layer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="bảy-stage-trong-log-source"&gt;Bảy stage trong log source&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
	&lt;thead&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;th&gt;Stage&lt;/th&gt;
					&lt;th&gt;Log&lt;/th&gt;
					&lt;th&gt;Logic thực tế&lt;/th&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
	&lt;/thead&gt;
	&lt;tbody&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;1&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;Processing Company Info&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Chọn snapshot info gần nhất hợp lệ tại/before &lt;code&gt;AS_OF_DATE&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;2&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;Processing Prices&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Dedupe price, daily return, annualized volatility, 12-month momentum&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;3&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;Processing Financials&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Dedupe reports, annualized ROE, debt-to-equity và growth; có fallback&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;4&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;Merging Data&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Join info, price metrics và financial metrics theo ticker&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;5&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;Calculating Percentiles&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Percentile 0–100, safety score và QMJ score&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;6&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;Building Final Table&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Rank giảm dần theo &lt;code&gt;qmj_score&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;7&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;Writing Processed Parquet&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Snappy Parquet theo &lt;code&gt;as_of_date&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
	&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;h2 id="công-thức-trong-source"&gt;Công thức trong source&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;-webkit-text-size-adjust:none;"&gt;&lt;code class="language-text" data-lang="text"&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;profitability_raw = financial_roe_raw
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; hoặc return_on_equity từ company info
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;growth_raw = financial_growth_raw
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; hoặc earnings_growth
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt; hoặc revenue_growth
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;qmj_safety = average(safety_volatility_score, safety_debt_score)
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="display:flex;"&gt;&lt;span&gt;qmj_score = average(qmj_profitability, qmj_growth, qmj_safety)
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;value_recent_score&lt;/code&gt; và &lt;code&gt;momentum_recent_score&lt;/code&gt; được tính/xuất ra, nhưng không tham gia công thức &lt;code&gt;qmj_score&lt;/code&gt; hiện tại.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>